ause they're fulfilled by their Resonant Essence. It's not insanity any more than cats killing and eating live animals is even if they have a bowl of kibble at home.<br /> <br /> Wounds want to spread. The write-up repeatedly compares Wounds to a cancer and describes it as wanting to infect others, and gives it mechanics to do so, such as giving spirits the negative resonance of the Wound (reflecting the associated Maeljin) and the ability to infect others and inhibiting the abilities of the uninfected in Wounds. Normally spirits don't infect other things. As established, even when claiming they're just moving themselves from one place to another, even the Seven Conflagrations spirits of Chicago just wanted more fire and so they started actual fires, they weren't infecting everything they came across with fire Resonance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 12-03-2025, 09:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-05T11:52:10-08:00","id":1556178,"title":"","content":"The spirit realmnis like an entire run of <i>An American Horror Story</i>, full of bizarre imagery and alien entities too strange to really ever understand.<br /> <br /> <i>Wounds</i>, however, are cancer even to the Hisil, the same way a Contagion outbreak can be. They're not the same thing, exactly, but both are <i>sicknesses</i> that even the non-Euclidean strangeness of the Shadow finds abhorrent.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28921,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28921-creatorfoundermak